#### Corresponding Project Code in Pseudocode:

**1. Implemented User Login Functionality**
```pseudocode
FUNCTION do_login
    Retrieve username from form input
    Retrieve password from form input
    IF user_manager.login(username, password) IS TRUE THEN
        Store username in session
        Redirect to '/dashboard'
    ELSE
        Redirect to '/'
END FUNCTION
```

**2. Implemented User Registration Functionality**
```pseudocode
FUNCTION register
    IF request method IS POST THEN
        Retrieve username from form input
        Retrieve password from form input
        IF user_manager.register(username, password) IS TRUE THEN
            Redirect to '/'
    RETURN render of 'register.html'
END FUNCTION
```

**3. Display Notes on Dashboard**
```pseudocode
FUNCTION dashboard
    IF 'username' EXISTS in session THEN
        Retrieve all notes for logged in user from note_manager
        RETURN render of 'dashboard.html' with notes
    ELSE
        Redirect to '/'
END FUNCTION
```

**4. Adding a New Note**
```pseudocode
FUNCTION add_note
    IF request method IS POST THEN
        Retrieve title from form input
        Retrieve content from form input
